2 \par  \par      Traders said sentiment was subdued on growing doubts about\par the pace of economic reforms and foreign investments.\par  -------------------------------------------------------------\par                                            MARKET SNAPSHOT\par                                  12:40 p.m.       9:15 a.m.\par     Bombay Sensitive Index (pts) 5,735.42           to open\par     Indian rupee (/$)           44.1875/1975    44.1800/1950\par     7.37 percent 2014 bond (%)     5.1131             5.0991\par     Call money (%)                 4.25/4.50       4.25/4.50\par     6-mth fwd annualised premium\par     (discount) (%)                 (0.18)            to open\par  -------------------------------------------------------------.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040428e04s001ez\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
